# Trivy/Aqua misconfig allow-list. Each entry MUST cite a rationale.
#
# AZU-0039 - "Linux virtual machine allows password authentication"
# False positive: modules/spoke-compute/main.tf sets
#   disable_password_authentication = local.use_ssh_key
# which is `true` whenever an SSH public key is supplied via
# var.vm_admin_ssh_public_key. Trivy cannot evaluate the conditional and flags
# the literal expression. Operators must set vm_admin_ssh_public_key in prod.
AZU-0039
